Actually the name of an artifact is in the artilist[] array defined in 
artilist.h and an object that is an artifact has an index to the 
corresponding artilist[] entry (oartifact defined on line 43 in obj.h).

So it would be possible to differentiate between The Magicbane and an 
athame named Magicbane. The first having its oartifact set to point to 
the correct entry in artilist[] the second only having the name 'Magicbane'.

But as already sombedy wrote it would make wishing for the artifact a 
no-brainer as you would always get at least the base item.

